  "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-01.htm",
   "quest": 19,
   "text": "Trader Vladimir: What.., is everyone here DEAF?! Hey... you! Can you help me? I ordered meat from that farm..., look at the crap they gave me! I'm too mad to go myself, I wonder if you would return this for me?",
   "header": "Trader Vladimir",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; level >= 82"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say you will.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00019_GoToThePastureland 31302-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland",
     "event": "31302-02.htm",
     "quest": 19,
     "to": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-02.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-03.html",
   "quest": 19,
   "text": "Trader Vladimir: You? How could someone as inexperienced as you TRULY know how to deal with meat? The answer is... you can't. Come back after you gain more experience. (Only character with level 82 or above can take on this quest.)",
   "header": "Trader Vladimir",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT level >= 82"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-04.html",
   "quest": 19,
   "text": "Trader Vladimir: Did you find the Farm manager? What are you doing? And can you get rid of this meat before it stinks? The quality isn't good enough.",
   "header": "Trader Vladimir",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00015_SweetWhispers/31302-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00015_SweetWhispers/31302-01.html",
   "quest": 15,
   "text": "Trader Vladimir: Excellent, I'll tell you what to do. Find the mysterious Necromancer at the entrance to the Valley of Saints . He'll help you test your fate. Look for someone from my guild if you should need help.",
   "header": "Trader Vladimir",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00019_GoToThePastureland/31302-02.htm",
   "quest": 19,
   "text": "Trader Vladimir: Is that you? Here. Take this meat! Farm Manager Tunatun sent it to me, but it's disgusting. I see red just thinking about it! I can't decide if he doesn't know any better, or if he's trying to slip one by me. Between you and me, I won't buy anything from him! Not if he paid me! But…",
   "header": "Trader Vladimir",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
